mytool.bmp: the toolbar icons of Sakura Editor
==============================================

Origin: https://github.com/sakura-editor/sakura, commit 48db6c7c25e2d98bdf47baab201826b4da8c7303,
file src/main/resources/images/mytool.bmp (the bitmap `IDB_MYTOOL` of the toolbar).

The file is included here unchanged (byte for byte). UME Editor cuts the icons out of it when it
runs (crates/ume-ui/src/bars/icons.rs): 16x16 pixels each, 32 icons in a row, and the colour of
the top left pixel is the transparent colour, as in Sakura's CImageListMgr. Nothing else was
changed.

